{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><div class=\"incontent\" id=\"blockcontent\" itemscope=\"\" itemtype=\"http://schema.org/Article\">\n<div class=\"colleft mt-1\" id=\"date\">\n<p class=\"date\" itemprop=\"datePublished\">發布日期   2026年8月13日 12:58 星期四</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"upper\"><p>生態環境部部長黃潤秋今（13日）表示，截至7月底，全國碳排放權交易市場累計成交量突破9.3億噸。（新華社）</p></div>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-13T05:20:29.046384+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":81,"images":0,"source":"明報 中國","fallback":"none"}}